>> numbers := ['1,2,3'] splitse: [','].
Utfier skriuwe: ['I got: '] + numbers telle + [' numbers.'],nije-rigel.
{ :i Utfier skriuwe: ['number #'] + i + [':'] + (numbers posysje: i), nije-rigel.} × 3.
>> beverages := ['Tea Or Coffee Or Milk Or Orange Juice Or Water'].
beverages := beverages splitse: [' Or '].
Utfier skriuwe: ['We serve'], nije-rigel.
{ :i Utfier skriuwe: ['->'] + (beverages posysje: i), nije-rigel. } × (beverages telle).
Utfier skriuwe: (beverages gearfoegje: [',']), nije-rigel.
Utfier skriuwe: (numbers gearfoegje: ['||']).
